<div class="header">
<h1>📡 Telecom Tools & Calculators Hub</h1>
<p>Paperless Mission | Jawad Ul Manzoor Foundation | Jeddah, KSA | Vision 2030</p>
</div>

<div class="rule-box">⚡ OUR ONE CORE RULE: SOLVE → RESET → TRY AGAIN ⚡</div>

<div class="container">
<div class="hero">
<h2>Free for Telecom Students & Industry Engineers</h2>
<p>All tools are <b>100% Free, No Login, Mobile Friendly</b>. We convert complex ITU-T & 3GPP formulas into one-click calculators. Just <b>Solve</b> your problem, <b>Reset</b> to clear, and <b>Try Again</b> with new values to master optimization.</p>
</div>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<span class="tag">OPTICAL FIBER</span>
<h3>1. ITU-T G.694.1 WDM Channel Spacing Calculator</h3>
<p>Calculate exact DWDM / CWDM wavelength & frequency for 12.5 GHz to 100 GHz grid. Must-have for Optical Transmission & Backbone design.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://telecomtoolsforsaudivision2030.blogspot.com/2026/09/itu-t-g6941-wdm-channel-spacing.html?m=1" target="_blank">Open Calculator →</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<span class="tag">FTTH / GPON</span>
<h3>2. GPON Optical Splitter Loss Calculator - Vision 2030</h3>
<p>Instant Insertion Loss & Power Budget for 1:2 to 1:128 splitters. Essential for FTTH, FTTx & ODN planning.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://telecomtoolsforsaudivision2030.blogspot.com/2026/08/202605gpon-optical-splitter-loss-calculator-vision-2030.html.html?m=1" target="_blank">Open Calculator →</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<span class="tag">ANTENNA DESIGN</span>
<h3>3. AI Voice S-Band Antenna Calculator</h3>
<p>Design S-Band (2-4 GHz) antennas for Satellite & 5G. Calculate gain, wavelength & dimensions with AI voice input.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://telecomtoolsforsaudivision2030.blogspot.com/2026/08/ai-voice-s-band-antenna-calculator-for.html?m=1" target="_blank">Open Calculator →</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<span class="tag">TRAFFIC ENGINEERING</span>
<h3>4. Erlang B vs Erlang C Capacity Planner</h3>
<p>Compare Blocking (Erlang B) vs Queuing (Erlang C) for Call Centers & Cellular Traffic. Critical for Core Network.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://telecomtoolsforsaudivision2030.blogspot.com/2026/05/erlang-b-vs-erlang-c-call-center-capacity-planner.html?m=1" target="_blank">Open Planner →</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<span class="tag">RF PLANNING</span>
<h3>5. Advanced RF Planning Report Generator</h3>
<p>Generate professional RF report with Project ID, Azimuth, Tilt & Coverage. Used by RF Drive Test & Optimization Teams.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://telecomtoolsforsaudivision2030.blogspot.com/2026/07/advanced-rf-planning-report-project-id_0541465333.html?m=1" target="_blank">Generate Report →</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<span class="tag">SATELLITE COMM</span>
<h3>6. Satellite Antenna Efficiency & Peak Gain Calculator</h3>
<p>Calculate Aperture Efficiency, Peak Gain (dBi) & Beamwidth for Parabolic / VSAT / Earth Station antennas.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://telecomtoolsforsaudivision2030.blogspot.com/2026/07/satellite-antenna-efficiency-peak-gain-calculator.html?m=1" target="_blank">Open Calculator →</a>
</div>

<div class="card" style="border-left-color:#ffcc00">
<span class="tag">6G RESEARCH</span>
<h3>7. Future 6G Research Hub - Saudi Vision 2030</h3>
<p>Explore Terahertz, AI-Native Networks, RIS & our 6G roadmap for KSA. Best for Final Year Projects & Research Papers.</p>
<a class="btn" style="background:#ffcc00;color:#0b2e5c" href="https://telecomtoolsforsaudivision2030.blogspot.com/2026/05/future-6g-research-saudi-arabia-vision-2030.html?m=1" target="_blank">Read Research →</a>
</div>

</div>

<div class="hero" style="margin-top:30px">
