<p><b>1. SOLVE:</b> Enter values → Get Result &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>2. RESET:</b> Click Reset for new scenario &nbsp; | &nbsp; <b>3. TRY AGAIN:</b> Test different values to learn optimization.</p>
